function normalizeImprovPackage(obj){if(!isPlainObject(obj)||hasDangerousKeys(obj))throw new Error("即兴开场不是有效对象");const opening=isPlainObject(obj.openingScene)?obj.openingScene:{},situation=normalizeDirectorSituation(obj.situation||obj.director||{});const normalizeNpc=(n,i)=>({id:asString(n?.id,100)||`npc-opening-${i+1}`,name:asString(n?.name,120)||`人物 ${i+1}`,description:asString(n?.publicDescription||n?.description,800),attitude:asString(n?.attitude,100),visibleBehavior:asString(n?.visibleBehavior,500),goal:asString(n?.goal,600)});const normalizeScene=(s,i)=>({id:asString(s?.id,100)||`improv-scene-${i+1}`,title:asString(s?.title,140)||`场景 ${i+1}`,location:asString(s?.location,180),description:asString(s?.description,2400),visibleDetails:listStrings(s?.visibleDetails,10,220),npcIds:listStrings(s?.npcIds,10,100),clues:Array.isArray(s?.clues)?s.clues.map((c,j)=>({id:asString(c?.id,100)||`improv-clue-${i+1}-${j+1}`,name:asString(c?.name,160)||`线索 ${j+1}`,description:asString(c?.description,800),hidden:c?.hidden!==false,protected:c?.protected!==false,acquisitionRoutes:Array.isArray(c?.acquisitionRoutes)?c.acquisitionRoutes.map(normalizeAcquisitionRoute):[]})).slice(0,8):[],checks:Array.isArray(s?.checks)?s.checks.map((c,j)=>normalizeScenarioCheckDefinition({...c,id:asString(c?.id,100)||`improv-check-${i+1}-${j+1}`},Boolean(c?.mandatory),asString(s?.id,100)||`improv-scene-${i+1}`)).slice(0,8):[],connections:Array.isArray(s?.connections)?s.connections.map((c,j)=>({id:asString(c?.id,100)||`connection-${i+1}-${j+1}`,label:asString(c?.label,180)||"继续调查",targetSceneId:asString(c?.targetSceneId,100),condition:isPlainObject(c?.condition)?deepClone(c.condition):null})).slice(0,8):[]});const pkg={title:asString(obj.title,120)||"未命名即兴调查",subtitle:asString(obj.subtitle,200),era:asString(obj.era,120),location:asString(obj.location,160),playerIdentity:asString(obj.playerIdentity,1000),premise:asString(obj.premise,1500),incitingIncident:asString(obj.incitingIncident,1000),knownFacts:listStrings(obj.knownFacts,8,400),caseObjectives:listStrings(obj.caseObjectives||obj.immediateObjectives,5,300),openingScene:{title:asString(opening.title,120)||"开场",location:asString(opening.location,160),time:asString(opening.time,100),description:asString(opening.description,5000),visibleDetails:listStrings(opening.visibleDetails,8,200)},openingNpcs:Array.isArray(obj.openingNpcs)?obj.openingNpcs.map(normalizeNpc).slice(0,8):[],suggestedActions:listStrings(obj.suggestedActions,4,180),initialLeads:normalizeLeadItems(obj.initialLeads,"lead"),unresolvedQuestions:normalizeLeadItems(obj.unresolvedQuestions,"question"),situation,sceneSeeds:Array.isArray(obj.sceneSeeds)?obj.sceneSeeds.map(normalizeScene).slice(0,7):[],loreCards:Array.isArray(obj.loreCards)?obj.loreCards.map(normalizeLoreCard).slice(0,30):[]};if(pkg.playerIdentity.length<10||pkg.premise.length<20||pkg.openingScene.description.length<300)throw new Error("AI 生成的开场信息过短：身份、委托和开场叙事必须完整，开场不少于 300 字");if(!pkg.caseObjectives.length)throw new Error("开场缺少案件委托");if(!pkg.suggestedActions.length)throw new Error("开场缺少行动参考");if(pkg.sceneSeeds.length<3)throw new Error("即兴情境至少需要 3 个可调查场景种子");const ids=new Set(pkg.sceneSeeds.map(s=>s.id));for(const scene of pkg.sceneSeeds)for(const link of scene.connections)if(link.targetSceneId&&!ids.has(link.targetSceneId))throw new Error(`场景 ${scene.title} 指向不存在的场景：${link.targetSceneId}`);return pkg}
function cancelImprovGeneration(){if(activeAbortController)activeAbortController.abort("user");state.runtime.improvGenerating=false;const button=$("#cancelImprovGenerationBtn");if(button)button.classList.add("hidden");toast("已取消即兴开场生成","warn")}
async function parseAndRepairImprovPackage(raw,requestId){let parsed=safeJsonParse(extractFirstJsonObject(raw));if(!parsed.ok){const repairPrompt=`只修复以下即兴开场 JSON 的语法，不改变字段内容，不新增剧情。必须保留 requestId=${requestId}。只返回 JSON。\n${raw}`;const repairedRaw=await callChatCompletion([{role:"system",content:"你是 JSON 语法修复器，只修复括号、引号和逗号。"},{role:"user",content:repairPrompt}],{timeoutMs:45000,jsonMode:true,temperature:0.2});parsed=safeJsonParse(extractFirstJsonObject(repairedRaw));if(!parsed.ok)throw new Error("即兴开场 JSON 自动修复后仍无法解析")}if(parsed.value.requestId&&parsed.value.requestId!==requestId)throw new Error("即兴开场 requestId 不匹配");return normalizeImprovPackage(parsed.value)}
async function generateImprovOpening(prefs){if(activeAbortController||state.runtime.improvGenerating)throw new Error("当前已有请求正在进行");state.runtime.improvGenerating=true;const requestId=uid("improv"),btn=$("#generateImprovBtn"),cancel=$("#cancelImprovGenerationBtn");if(btn){btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent="正在生成…"}cancel?.classList.remove("hidden");const schema={protocolVersion:"1.2",requestId,title:"",subtitle:"",era:"",location:"",playerIdentity:"",premise:"",incitingIncident:"",knownFacts:[],caseObjectives:[],openingScene:{title:"",location:"",time:"",description:"不少于300字",visibleDetails:[]},openingNpcs:[],suggestedActions:[],initialLeads:[],unresolvedQuestions:[],situation:{establishedFacts:[],unknownPossibilities:[],factions:[],npcMotives:[],threatClocks:[],pressures:[],openQuestions:[],possibleConsequences:[],possibleEndings:[]},sceneSeeds:[{id:"scene-a",title:"",location:"",description:"",visibleDetails:[],npcIds:[],clues:[{id:"clue-a",name:"",description:"",hidden:true,acquisitionRoutes:[{id:"route-a",type:"check",checkId:"check-a",minimumRank:"regular"},{id:"route-b",type:"failure_forward",cost:{tension:1}}]}],checks:[{id:"check-a",type:"skill",skillId:"spot_hidden",visibility:"public",mandatory:false,reason:"",purpose:""}],connections:[{label:"",targetSceneId:"scene-b"}]}],loreCards:[]};const prompt=`为单人调查型 TRPG 生成可响应玩家的情境图，不要生成固定剧情路线。只返回 JSON。开场叙事必须包含空间、光线、声音、气味、人物、异常和限制，不少于300个中文字符。生成 3～5 个可任意顺序调查的场景种子；每条关键线索至少有两种获取路线，其中一种允许失败前进；设置明骰、暗骰和必要 SAN 暴露点。导演信息描述当前事实、NPC/势力目标和威胁时钟，不规定玩家必经顺序。至少准备撤退、部分成功、代价成功或威胁扩散结局。\n角色：${JSON.stringify({name:state.character.name,occupation:state.character.occupation||state.character.className,background:state.character.background||state.character.notes,skills:Array.isArray(state.character.skills)?state.character.skills.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value).slice(0,10).map(s=>({id:s.id,name:s.name,value:s.value})):state.character.skills})}\n偏好：${JSON.stringify(prefs)}\n结构：${JSON.stringify(schema)}`;try{const raw=await callChatCompletion([{role:"system",content:"你是调查型 TRPG 情境设计器。世界必须响应玩家，禁止线性唯一解。"},{role:"user",content:prompt}],{timeoutMs:Math.max(60000,state.config.timeoutMs),jsonMode:true,temperature:0.45});const pkg=await parseAndRepairImprovPackage(raw,requestId);state.runtime.improvDraft=pkg;showImprovPreview(pkg,prefs)}finally{state.runtime.improvGenerating=false;cancel?.classList.add("hidden");if(btn?.isConnected){btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent="生成开场档案"}}}
